[{"answer":"So, I understand you're interested in restaurant work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I've got a bit of experience and I can provide references.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/2.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good. I can check all that later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, Milo's Restaurants have some vacancies at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/4.mp3"},{"answer":"They're a really good company to work for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Lots of benefits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. They've got a very good reputation for looking after staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/8-2024-11-18-23-57-47.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, all employees get training, even temporary staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh really? That's quite unusual, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/11.mp3"},{"answer":"And do staff get free uniforms too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... you just need to wear a white T-shirt and black trousers, it says here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/13.mp3"},{"answer":"So I guess not...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/14.mp3"},{"answer":"But another benefit of working for a big company like this","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/15.mp3"},{"answer":"is that you can get a discount at any of their restaurants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Even at weekends?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/17.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but you'll be working then anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. I suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... most of their restaurants are in the city centre, aren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So, easy to get to by bus?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/22.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you have to do a late shift and finish work after midnight,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/23.mp3"},{"answer":"the company will pay for you to get a taxi home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I probably won't need one. I think I'd use my bike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, they do have some quite specific requirements for the kind of person they're looking for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Milo's is a young, dynamic company","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're really keen on creating a strong team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really important that you can fit in and get on well with everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I've got no problem with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds good, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The last place I worked for was quite demanding too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/33.mp3"},{"answer":"We had to make sure we gave a really high level of service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good to hear because that will be equally important at Milo's.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I know they want people who have an eye for detail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine. I'm very used to working in that kind of environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So the only other thing that's required is good communication skills,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/39.mp3"},{"answer":"so you'll need to have a certificate in English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/41.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Let's have a look at the current job vacancies at Milo's.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/42.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one is in Wivenhoe Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, where?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Wivenhoe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/45.mp3"},{"answer":"W-I-V-E-N-H-O-E.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite central, just off Cork Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/48.mp3"},{"answer":"They're looking for a breakfast supervisor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/49.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So you're probably familiar with the kind of responsibilities involved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously checking that all the portions are correct, etc.,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and then things like checking all the procedures for cleaning the equipment are being followed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/53.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the salary?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/55.mp3"},{"answer":"In my last job I was getting £9.50 per hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I was hoping to get a bit more than that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, to begin with, you'd be getting £9.75","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but that goes up to £11.25 after three months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That's not too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And I suppose it's a very early start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the only unattractive thing about this job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/62.mp3"},{"answer":"But then you have the afternoons and evenings free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So the restaurant starts serving breakfast from 7 a.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'd have to be there at 5.30 to set everything up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/65.mp3"},{"answer":"But you'd be finished at 12.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as you say, there are advantages to that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you might also be interested in the job at the City Road branch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/68.mp3"},{"answer":"That's for a junior chef, so again a position of responsibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I might prefer that, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well obviously this role would involve supporting the sous chef and other senior staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'd be responsible for making sure there's enough stock each week","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/72.mp3"},{"answer":"and sorting out all the deliveries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never done that before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/74.mp3"},{"answer":"but I imagine it's fairly straightforward, once you get the hang of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and you'd be working alongside more experienced staff to begin with,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/76.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'm sure it wouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/77.mp3"},{"answer":"The salary's slightly higher here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/78.mp3"},{"answer":"It's an annual salary of £23,000.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that if they like you, it's likely you'll be promoted quite quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/81.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's worth thinking about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It does sound interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/83.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the hours like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/84.mp3"},{"answer":"The usual, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/85.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a lot of evening and weekend work, but they're closed on Mondays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/86.mp3"},{"answer":"But you do get one Sunday off every four weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/87.mp3"},{"answer":"So would you like me to send off your...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-2-part-1-2023-06-17-08-35-16/88.mp3"}]
